            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EBetterIcons is a modern, powerful property editor for Umbraco CMS that provides access to 200,000\u002B icons from popular icon libraries including Material Design Icons, Font Awesome, Bootstrap Icons, and 100\u002B more. Built with React for a smooth, responsive user experience with smart search, color customization, and zero configuration.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://marketplace.umbraco.com/package/umbraco.community.bettericons\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003ERead the original article\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
